
### Pruebas de la API con REST Client de VS Code

@url = http://localhost:3000/api

### =====================================
### 1. COMPROBAR SERVIDOR
### =====================================

GET {{url}}/health


### =====================================
### 2. LOGIN
### =====================================

POST {{url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuario": "marita",
  "password": "MiClave123"
}

### Copiar el token de la respuesta y pegarlo acá
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MSwibm9tYnJlIjoiTWFyaXRhIEhhZCIsInJvbCI6IkFkbWluaXN0cmFkb3JhIiwiaWF0IjoxNzkzNDY5NzE3LCJleHAiOjE3OTM0OTg1MTd9.0X_xbDJnV374QRjU7YvyULDE7wnLRzYjjNOhmJyIvDo


### =====================================
### CLIENTES
### =====================================

### 3. Listar clientes
GET {{url}}/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 4. Crear cliente
POST {{url}}/clientes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nombre": "Lucía",
  "apellido": "Pérez",
  "telefono": "2364123456",
  "email": "lucia@mail.com",
  "dni": "30123456",
  "calle": "Belgrano",
  "numero": "450",
  "localidad": "Pergamino",
  "obs": "Cliente de prueba"
}


### 5. Eliminar cliente
DELETE {{url}}/clientes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 6. Probar clientes sin token
GET {{url}}/clientes


### =====================================
### PROVEEDORES
### =====================================

### 7. Listar proveedores
GET {{url}}/proveedores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 8. Crear proveedor
POST {{url}}/proveedores
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nombre": "Distribuidora Textil",
  "telefono": "2364123456",
  "email": "distribuidora@mail.com",
  "cuit": "30712345678",
  "calle": "San Martín",
  "numero": "350",
  "localidad": "Junín",
  "obs": "Proveedor de telas"
}


### 9. Modificar proveedor
PUT {{url}}/proveedores/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nombre": "Distribuidora Textil Actualizada",
  "telefono": "2364987654",
  "email": "contacto@mail.com",
  "cuit": "30712345678",
  "calle": "San Martín",
  "numero": "350",
  "localidad": "Junín",
  "obs": "Proveedor actualizado"
}


### 10. Eliminar proveedor
DELETE {{url}}/proveedores/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 11. Probar proveedores sin token
GET {{url}}/proveedores
